<p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--mute);max-width:72ch;margin:22px 0 0">Sketched as three linked boxes rather than one screen at a time &mdash; checking the same team names and counts held together across teams, profile and project before any of it got real pixels. The open questions above became the assumptions flagged below.</p>
